Package: workspacenumber
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: workspace number tray indicator for V\OS
 WorkspaceNumber is a Deskbar tray item that shows the number of the
 current workspace. Left-click opens the Workspaces applet, the mouse
 wheel switches workspaces while hovering the item, and a right-click
 menu offers About and removing the item.
